{"id":"92178dc88a5e0bd4","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-partial-recursive-class.md","title":"Partial Recursive Class","display":"df-partial-recursive-class — Partial Recursive Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-partial-recursive-class","aliases":["88-df-partial-recursive-class"],"display":"df-partial-recursive-class — Partial Recursive Class","depends_on":["[[88-df-primitive-recursive-class]]","[[88-df-minimization-operator]]","[[88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme]]","[[88-df-partial-function]]","[[88-df-kleene-equality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-partial-recursive-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-partial-recursive-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-recursive-class — Partial Recursive Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ce76a1073595f5b0\" href=\"?note=ce76a1073595f5b0\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive-class\">88-df-primitive-recursive-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9706166a50cc2c4\" href=\"?note=d9706166a50cc2c4\" title=\"88-df-minimization-operator\">88-df-minimization-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"73df252510501ed2\" href=\"?note=73df252510501ed2\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme\">88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d585cbf989199162\" href=\"?note=d585cbf989199162\" title=\"88-df-partial-function\">88-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" href=\"?note=5f7e8cd4c12441fb\" title=\"88-df-kleene-equality\">88-df-kleene-equality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{part}}\">\\(\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{part}}\\)</span> (all finite-arity partial number-theoretic functions)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialFunction}\\)</span> (partial-function predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{PartRec}\">\\(\\mathcal{PartRec}\\)</span> (partial-recursive function class)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{PR}\">\\(\\mathcal{PR}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ce76a1073595f5b0\" href=\"?note=ce76a1073595f5b0\" title=\"88-df-primitive-recursive-class\">88-df-primitive-recursive-class</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartPrimRecScheme}_k(f;g,h)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartPrimRecScheme}_k(f;g,h)\\)</span> (partial primitive-recursion predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MinOp}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{MinOp}_k\\)</span> (minimization predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9706166a50cc2c4\" href=\"?note=d9706166a50cc2c4\" title=\"88-df-minimization-operator\">88-df-minimization-operator</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>输入元组中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle n,\\vec x\\rangle\">\\(\\langle n,\\vec x\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle n,z,\\vec x\\rangle\">\\(\\langle n,z,\\vec x\\rangle\\)</span> 分别为前接一个、两个分量后的扁平元组；外层有序对只用来编码函数图。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{part}}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\n\\{f:\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{part}}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\n\\{f:\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PartPrimRecScheme}_k(f;g,h)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nk\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(g,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(h,\\mathbb N^{k+2},\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^{k+1},\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle\\langle0,\\vec x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in f\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in g\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle\\langle n+1,\\vec x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in f\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists z\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\langle\\langle n,\\vec x\\rangle,z\\rangle\\in f\n\\land\\langle\\langle n,z,\\vec x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in h)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PartPrimRecScheme}_k(f;g,h)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nk\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(g,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(h,\\mathbb N^{k+2},\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^{k+1},\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle\\langle0,\\vec x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in f\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in g\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle\\langle n+1,\\vec x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in f\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists z\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\langle\\langle n,\\vec x\\rangle,z\\rangle\\in f\n\\land\\langle\\langle n,z,\\vec x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in h)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal{PartRec}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{part}}:\n&amp;\\mathcal{PR}\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall m\\geq1\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad g:\\mathbb N^m\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\n\\land\\bigwedge_{j=1}^m h_j:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\n(\\vec x,y)\\in f\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;[(\\forall j\\;(1\\leq j\\leq m\\to(\\vec x,z_j)\\in h_j))\n\\land(\\vec z,y)\\in g]\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\to f\\in\\mathcal C\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f,g,h\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{PartPrimRecScheme}_k(f;g,h)\\land g,h\\in\\mathcal C\n\\to f\\in\\mathcal C\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{MinOp}_k(\\mu_k(g);g)\\to\\mu_k(g)\\in\\mathcal C\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal{PartRec}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{part}}:\n&amp;\\mathcal{PR}\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall m\\geq1\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\quad g:\\mathbb N^m\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\n\\land\\bigwedge_{j=1}^m h_j:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\n(\\vec x,y)\\in f\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;[(\\forall j\\;(1\\leq j\\leq m\\to(\\vec x,z_j)\\in h_j))\n\\land(\\vec z,y)\\in g]\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad{}\\to f\\in\\mathcal C\\Bigr]\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f,g,h\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{PartPrimRecScheme}_k(f;g,h)\\land g,h\\in\\mathcal C\n\\to f\\in\\mathcal C\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{MinOp}_k(\\mu_k(g);g)\\to\\mu_k(g)\\in\\mathcal C\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>部分递归函数通过<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span>操作扩展原始递归</li>\n<li>部分复合的图条件显式规定：所有内函数先收敛，外函数随后收敛。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(n,f(n,\\vec x),\\vec x)\">\\(h(n,f(n,\\vec x),\\vec x)\\)</span>按严格部分应用解释：若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(n,\\vec x)\">\\(f(n,\\vec x)\\)</span>未定义，\n则整个嵌套应用未定义；因此上面的Kleene等式同时约束收敛与函数值。</li>\n<li>与 Turing 可计算函数等价是后续定理，不是最小闭包定义的一部分。</li>\n<li>部分递归函数可能不终止</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive-class","status":"resolved","id":"ce76a1073595f5b0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-primitive-recursive-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-minimization-operator","status":"resolved","id":"d9706166a50cc2c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-minimization-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme","status":"resolved","id":"73df252510501ed2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-primitive-recursion-scheme]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"d585cbf989199162","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-kleene-equality","status":"resolved","id":"5f7e8cd4c12441fb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-kleene-equality]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-primitive-recursive-class","status":"resolved","id":"ce76a1073595f5b0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{PR}$ (primitive-recursive class, see [[88-df-primitive-recursive-class]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-minimization-operator","status":"resolved","id":"d9706166a50cc2c4","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MinOp}_k$ (minimization predicate, see [[88-df-minimization-operator]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{part}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialFunction}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{PartRec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{PR}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartPrimRecScheme}_k(f;g,h)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MinOp}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle n,\\vec x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle n,z,\\vec x\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{part}}\\coloneqq\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\n\\{f:\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PartPrimRecScheme}_k(f;g,h)\\leftrightarrow{}&\nk\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(g,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(h,\\mathbb N^{k+2},\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^{k+1},\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\langle\\langle0,\\vec x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in f\n\\leftrightarrow\\langle\\vec x,y\\rangle\\in g\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n,y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\n\\Bigl(\\langle\\langle n+1,\\vec x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in f\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists z\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\langle\\langle n,\\vec x\\rangle,z\\rangle\\in f\n\\land\\langle\\langle n,z,\\vec x\\rangle,y\\rangle\\in h)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal{PartRec}\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\Bigl\\{\\mathcal C\\subseteq\\mathcal F_{\\mathrm{part}}:\n&\\mathcal{PR}\\subseteq\\mathcal C\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall m\\geq1\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\forall g,h_1,\\ldots,h_m\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\forall f\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&\\quad g:\\mathbb N^m\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\n\\land\\bigwedge_{j=1}^m h_j:\\mathbb N^k\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\n\\land\\mathrm{PartialFunction}(f,\\mathbb N^k,\\mathbb N)\\\\\n&\\quad{}\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\n(\\vec x,y)\\in f\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\vec z\\in\\mathbb N^m\\;[(\\forall j\\;(1\\leq j\\leq m\\to(\\vec x,z_j)\\in h_j))\n\\land(\\vec z,y)\\in g]\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad{}\\to f\\in\\mathcal C\\Bigr]\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f,g,h\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{PartPrimRecScheme}_k(f;g,h)\\land g,h\\in\\mathcal C\n\\to f\\in\\mathcal C\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall g\\in\\mathcal C\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{MinOp}_k(\\mu_k(g);g)\\to\\mu_k(g)\\in\\mathcal C\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu","display":false},{"tex":"h(n,f(n,\\vec x),\\vec x)","display":false},{"t